        "item_key": "IS1008a#0",
        "type": "actions",
        "text": "FIE073 will deliver a written plan including the functional design, the technical design, the required headcount, the time frame, and the budget, and coordinate with marketing."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "IS1008a#1",
        "type": "actions",
        "text": "MIE085 will provide a written project plan by the next meeting."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "IS1008a#2",
        "type": "problems",
        "text": "There is no written project plan available to present to management; without documentation, we cannot request funding."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "IS1008a#3",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "The project scope is defined to focus on a remote control product, starting with a television remote control."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "IS1008a#4",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "The written project plan must be delivered within two weeks."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "IS1008a#5",
        "type": "actions",
        "text": "FIE038 will keep MIE085 (Ed) in the loop by copying him on all discussions or documents."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "IS1008a#6",
        "type": "actions",
        "text": "FIE038 will copy all emails and discussions to MIO086."
      }
